    "innovation": "This paper improves the representation of Arctic carbon cycle processes by implementing empirically-based broadleaf deciduous and needle-leaved evergreen shrub types into the QUINCY terrestrial biosphere model to assess the impact of shrub cover on carbon uptake and storage.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
