            "target_entity_instance": "15 vertically-discretized soil layers",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalFeature",
            "paragraph": "The soil is explicitly vertically-discretized in 15 layers with increasing thickness down to a depth of 9.5 m. This applies for soil temperature, texture, moisture and the biogeochemical soil pools.",
