        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "QUINCY v1.0",
            "source_entity_type": "Source",
            "relation": "USES_PHYSICAL_SCHEME",
            "target_entity_instance": "full nitrogen cycle simulation",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "In particular, the model accounts for the full nitrogen cycle in the soil, simulating nitrogen inputs through symbiotic (microbial) fixation at higher plants and free-living (asymbiotic) N fixation at all parts of the ecosystem, N deposition, and the transformation processes mineralization, nitrification and denitrification, as well as transport between soil layers.",
