            "target_entity_instance": "R2",
            "target_entity_type": "Metric",
            "paragraph": "With this new implementation, shrubs showed reasonable seasonal cycle of gross primary production (GPP) at 50% of the Arctic study sites. The model achieved mean R2 values of 0.5 and 0.6, when compared with in situ measurements and remote sensing products for modeled shrubs.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
